{
    "description": "Each case pairs a probe result with the outcome that built-in host monitoring records for the same upstream observation and expected status. diagnostics is the stage result the platform derives the probe result from: stages from the upstream-only check, an error instead of a result, or null when the platform did not run the check. monitoring is null when built-in monitoring records no observation. An app reproduces monitoring from result and expectedStatus alone.",
